{
	"info": {
		"_postman_id": "venue-api-tests-2025",
		"name": "Venue API Tests",
		"description": "Comprehensive test collection for Venue API endpoints (Phase 7.1.1: Google Places API Integration).\n\nThis collection tests all venue endpoints including:\n- Google Places API search and details\n- Event venue management (CRUD)\n- Venue reordering\n- Error handling and validation\n\n**Setup:**\n1. Import this collection into Postman\n2. Import the Venue-API-Local environment\n3. Set the event_id variable to a valid event UUID\n4. Ensure backend is running on http://localhost:8000\n5. Run the \"1. Setup & Authentication\" folder first\n6. Execute requests sequentially or run entire collection\n\n**Features:**\n- ~25 requests across 6 folders\n- ~50+ automated test assertions\n- Auto-saves IDs for request chaining\n- Bearer token authentication\n- Comprehensive error scenarios\n\n**Documentation:** See VENUE-API-TESTING-GUIDE.md",
		"schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
	},
	"auth": {
		"type": "bearer",
		"bearer": [
			{
				"key": "token",
				"value": "{{access_token}}",
				"type": "string"
			}
		]
	},
